WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:27.730
Now, everyone,
the shocking truth!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:32.590
Neo Germany's Gundam Fighter,
Schwarz Bruder...

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:36.570
...is actually an android, identical
to Domon's brother, Kyoji!

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:37.740
Moreover...

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.820
...the incident that took place
a year ago...

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.910
...was, in fact, fabricated by
Major Ulube and Dr. Mikamura...

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:47.410
...to secure the Devil Gundam
as part of their evil plans!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.380
Meanwhile...

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.880
...on Lantau Island, Bolt Gundam
and Dragon Gundam...

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.880
...sacrifice themselves to defeat
Gundam Heaven's Sword...

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:00.300
And as Domon rushes to take on
the Devil Gundam.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.050
...Master Asia sends...

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:06.350
...another to stand in his way...
The John Bull Gundam!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:07.730
And now!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.640
Gundam Fight!

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.270
Ready! Go!

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:18.360
Royal Counterattack!
Ambush of the Grand Gundam

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:21.510
Chapman!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.610
Sorry but I have to finish you off quickly!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.450
Erupting...

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.960
...God Finger!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.430
This is...!

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.980
I see. So that Gundam was...

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:58.990
...Chapman!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.070
It was you!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.210
You hear that?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.670
What was it?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.460
That voice?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.290
Yes, that voice.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.290
Is it...?

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:17.960
I'm quite sure it is.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.680
It's the voice of that huge
Gundam that attacked George!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:25.640
You're saying it's on that island?!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:26.760
Yes.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.220
We must hurry and
help George and the others.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.180
Wait.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.480
It won't be that easy.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.680
Schwarz Bruder?!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.570
What're you doing here?

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.360
We'll talk later.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.850
For now, watch this.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.450
The barrier extends that high?!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.910
That's right.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.210
I tried to find a way inside.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.130
But there's a double barrier...

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.800
...on both the inside and outside
of the posts.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.260
What's more...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.800
...the barrier spans above,
below the sea, and underground.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.050
So the Fighters can't escape...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.710
...and they can't get outside help.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.720
That's the Battle Royale ring.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.730
If that's true, is there
nothing we can do?!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.730
George and the others
are trapped inside there!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.230
But if you're hasty in trying to
break in, it'll cost you your lives.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:25.860
It's easy for you, because nobody
in there is important to you!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.870
You don't understand
how we're feeling!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:28.870
No.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:32.000
I'm probably more upset
than any of you.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:34.290
Yes.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.830
Schwarz is right.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.290
At the moment,
we're powerless to do anything.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.800
Shining Gundam?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.640
What are all of you doing here?

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.100
Rain!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.350
Where'd you get that Gundam?

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.560
This is Rising Gundam.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.480
Major Ulube had left it behind.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:00.360
It's on par with both Shining
Gundam and God Gundam.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.820
It has serious power.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.740
Two Gundams...

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.280
I know!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.530
We can break through the barrier!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:08.890
What?

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.980
Think it'll work?

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:29.550
Watch.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.970
The two Gundams generate
a force with maximum energy...

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.310
...thereby creating a virtual barrier.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:41.060
This force will draw the island's
barrier toward it and create a gap.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:42.980
If we enter the gap...

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.280
...and destroy one corner post...

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.610
...the whole barrier will
automatically disappear!

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.540
Hang on, Domon.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.040
I'll be right there.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:56.330
Please.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.980
I hope I can make it.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.120
My body!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.690
What firepower!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.210
The second of our Four Kings
of the Devil Gundam...

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.800
...the Grand Gundam.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.800
And resurrected with DG cells...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.760
...Chapman is more powerful...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:59.180
...than when he won three Gundam
Fight Championships in a row.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.850
Well, Domon.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.970
Are you able to rise above him?

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.950
Wh-what is it?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.240
Domon...

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.290
Are you all right?!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.750
George!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:19.870
Then that was...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.290
Gundam Maxter!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.250
Chibodee?!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.250
Domon!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.750
Leave him to us!

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.100
Chibodee!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.310
Watch out!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.190
Chapman is piloting
that Gundam!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.570
Yee-hah.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.860
Great!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:53.030
I always wanted to square off
with you in a shootout!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.120
Yeah, this is awesome!

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.110
Chibodee!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.880
Go!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.420
Rose Bits!

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:21.930
That should at least
buy us a little time.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.140
Domon Kasshu!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:26.480
Now's your chance to go
to the Devil Gundam!

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:27.730
What?

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:30.070
We'll handle it from here!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.820
Don't be stupid!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.740
There's no way
I can leave you here!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.320
Nonsense!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.530
There's no time for discussion!

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.120
If we wait any longer...

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.540
...the Devil Gundam will really
start to make a move.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.910
Domon!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.840
We made a promise!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.340
That once we fought against you...

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.800
...we would join forces and fight
to defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.840
Right now is that time!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.340
But...

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.640
When the Devil Gundam appeared
back in the Guyana Highlands...

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.310
...you stayed behind to fight
that monster on your own!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.560
This time it's our turn
to take the spotlight.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.470
George...

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:09.740
Chibodee...

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:16.200
I've already lost two great friends,
Argo and Sai Saici.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.490
I can't afford...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.930
Who're you kidding?!

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:24.540
We're not going to be beaten
that easily!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.610
Don't worry!

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:28.000
We'll get rid of this guy
and catch up to you!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.920
Quick!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.630
Time is of the essence!

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.090
Now is our chance!

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.010
Domon Kasshu!

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:41.260
I'm sorry!
George! Chibodee!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.180
Stay alive!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.360
He's finally gone.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.980
The very best of luck.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.160
Chapman!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.830
The difference between our
firepower is just too great!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.170
Oh, no!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.250
Chibodee Crocket!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.940
What's wrong, Shirley?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.810
I thought I heard
Chibodee screaming.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:32.810
Stop it.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.190
Don't creep me out.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:35.460
But...

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:43.870
Chibodee...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.240
We're not going to be beaten
that easily!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.620
I'll do it.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.890
I'll defeat him!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.500
Helped again by your friends,
huh?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.210
After all these years,
you still can't fight on your own.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.970
Let's see.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.220
It's about time I joined in
on the fun.

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:25.030
Th-that's...

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.500
Nobel Gundam?!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:45.140
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.680
Allenby?

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.680
Is that Allenby?!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.020
If so, talk to me!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.670
What're you doing here?!

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:57.650
Allenby, answer me!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.840
There's no need for that.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:01.030
Now, get rid of him!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.110
Allenby!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.580
What's wrong, Allenby?!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.750
Don't you recognize me?!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.250
Wong!

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.750
What's going on here?!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:20.550
The Fighter we require
is not Domon Kasshu.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.470
It's Allenby Beardsley.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.880
I've already made that
clear to you.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.840
You're always like that.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.430
Someone does your fighting
for you...

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.430
...and you hide away
somewhere safe.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:35.440
Where's the joy in conquering
the world that way?!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.480
I'm growing tired
of your lectures.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.150
Today, you can watch...

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:43.950
...as your pupil gets crushed
by my enchanting doll.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.640
Very well.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.910
Let's see how far your
wits will take you.

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.320
Allenby!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.250
Stop this now!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.090
Allenby!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.720
Allenby...!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.850
Rose Screamer!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.300
Now's the chance!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.820
Well? Can you stand?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.790
How could I lose track
of my bullets?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.000
I must really be out of it.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:46.670
Where are you?!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.350
The bits weren't enough...

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.810
...to cause any fatal damage.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.360
Our only choice...

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.190
...is to get up close and
fire through his cockpit.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.770
But my last gun is low on energy.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.270
I can only fire one more shot.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:06.110
Then there's only one way.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.580
Yeah!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.850
It's risky, but we have to do it.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.370
Domon Kasshu...

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.120
I wonder if he's been able to
find the Devil Gundam yet.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.380
How about a wager?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.460
On whether he can beat
the Devil Gundam?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.590
The loser pays for drinks.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.750
You sure amaze me.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:31.900
Why do you insist on
being so irresponsible?

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.930
Having something like that
stowed away in your cockpit.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:38.600
You sure are no fun.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.270
Do you enjoy life being
so uptight like that?

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.360
In my opinion...

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:46.230
...there's not enough grace
and elegance in your lifestyle.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.990
Hey, what's that?

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.700
Oh, uh...

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.330
But, you know...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:05.240
...just like you with
your champagne...

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:09.130
...I was going to give this guy
some bourbon if he'd won.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.380
As for regrets...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:15.600
...I was hoping I'd die
in the arms of a woman.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.270
Any other regrets besides
those involving women?

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.650
Not really.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.890
I've done everything I wanted to do.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:29.150
Well, I regret not winning
the Tournament...

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:32.280
...and showing the world
the American Dream.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.120
And you?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.390
Well...

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.080
I would have liked to have fought
an all-out match against you.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.750
Forgot that one.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:45.290
I would've socked you in your
conceited pretty face.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.500
Same goes for me.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.560
Guess he found us.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:02.890
Let's do it.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.070
Let's survive this!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.030
For both of us!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.120
It's the best I can do!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:25.790
Hurry now!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.460
But the gap's too small.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.000
I'll go.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.420
Y-you really mustn't!

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.010
The slightest touch to the barrier
will kill you!

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:38.640
That's why it makes sense
to have the smallest go.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:40.590
I must help somehow.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.390
Or how can I face
George and the others?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.230
George, hang in there.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.280
Miss Maria Louise!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.310
Here he comes.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.080
Just like we planned.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.500
Good luck, my friend!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.630
Monsieur Chapman!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.130
As the head of the
de Sand Family...

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.510
...I claim revenge for that
incident some time ago!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.900
It's our one chance.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.860
Come on, baby.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.620
Come get me!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:58.930
Here I go!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.600
Rose Hurricane!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.070
Now, Chibodee!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.070
Firing!

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.360
Oh, no!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.760
Perish!

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:46.520
Chibodee!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.060
Miss Marie Louise!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.020
I'm past it.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.450
Hurry up! The corner post!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.310
Just destroy the post...

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.250
George!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.170
I did it!

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:30.600
Are you okay?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:31.730
Yeah.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.850
But I can't move for now.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:36.570
Could you go on ahead?

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:37.730
All right!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.240
We'd better hurry, too!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.780
Shirley!

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.220
Bunny!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.180
Cath!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.010
Janet!

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.690
I'm sorry to leave you,
Maria Louise...

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.800
...without a proper farewell.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:15.980
A Rose Bit!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.980
We still have a chance!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:23.200
For Miss Marie Louise!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:33.460
George!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.210
The Rose Bit!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.460
I see.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.670
I'll use it as a bullet.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.170
Hurry...!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.140
Okay!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.270
Your time is up.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:55.940
We won this battle!

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.860
Goodbye, champ!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.540
Chibodee!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.500
George!

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:25.320
Can't be...!

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.510
Not both of them?!

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.060
Domon!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.580
Now, fight me.

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:38.650
Fight me!

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.020
Fight me now!

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:45.240
Allenby...

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.450
Let's fight, Domon!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:50.910
Fight!

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:52.450
Against me!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.320
Allenby...

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:55.660
You've been exposed to DG cells?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.460
Domon!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.500
Stop, Allenby!

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:04.590
H-hey, that's...

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:08.680
The Rising Gundam?!

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.760
But who's inside it?!

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.160
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:36.450
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.000
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.060
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.200
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:17.660
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:26.500
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:35.560
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.470
Rain faces a possessed Allenby.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:42.810
In the middle of this, Domon
learns of Schwarz's sad identity.

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:46.690
And in order to free Kyoji
and Schwarz from the evil spell...

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:49.440
...Domon must conjure up
the Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:51.740
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:56.120
Schwarz Rests in Grace!
Domon's Tearful Attack

00:23:54.700 --> 00:24:01.410
Schwarz Rests in Grace!
Domon's Tearful Attack

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.160
Ready! Go!
